    "description": "<p>This table acts as the central reference database for the project, indexed by unique<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&#160;</span><b>SWIFT Codes</b>. It maps each code to critical banking attributes, including the official<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&#160;</span><b>Bank Name</b>,<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&#160;</span><b>Country</b>, and specific<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&#160;</span><b>Routing Method</b><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&#160;</span>(e.g., SEPA_INST, WIRE_FAST).</p><p>The decision logic queries this dataset to verify bank existence and retrieve banks data.</p>"
